ctive_models\", [])\n        self.state.converged = data.get(\"converged\", False)\n        self.state.convergence_reason = data.get(\"convergence_reason\", \"\")\n        self.state.failed = data.get(\"failed\", False)\n        self.state.failure_reason = data.get(\"failure_reason\", \"\")\n>>>>\n\nFOLLOW: This changes signal_complete() after recovery, because status now correctly returns FAILED when appropriate. It also affects any orchestrator logic that checks BrainState.failed after load_checkpoint(). Backward compatibility is safe because missing keys default to False/empty string."
