    "DESCRIPTION": "FIND: `bench/immune_agents.py`, function `run_immune_pipeline()`, Stage 3b around the calls to `regulatory_t_cell_check()` and `regulatory_t_v2_shadow()`. The code passes `final_verdicts` *after* they have already been replaced by the reconciliation output (`final_verdicts = reconciled_verdicts`). But `regulatory_t_cell_check()` is the v1 checker and its documented/input assumptions are about raw v1 synthesis output, not the merged v1+v2 result. Evidence: Stage 3a computes `final_verdicts, final_confidences = helper_t_cell_synthesize(...)`; Stage 3a' computes `v2_final, v2_conf = helper_t_v2_shadow(...)`; Stage 3a.5 reconciles them and overwrites `final_verdicts`; only then Stage 3b calls both regulators with the reconciled map. This makes the logged comparison `v1_autoimmune` vs `v2_autoimmune` invalid because both are inspecting the same merged verdict set. That is a logic error in the validation path and masks disagreement between the regulators.",
    "PROPOSED_FIX": "FIX: preserve separate verdict maps for each regulator and only reconcile after both meta-checks if that is the intended policy, or at minimum feed v1 regulator the raw v1 synthesis and v2 regulator the v2 synthesis. Exact replacement:\n<<<<\n    final_verdicts, final_confidences = helper_t_cell_synthesize(triaged, all_verdicts)\n    timings[\"helper_t\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # ── Stage 3a': Helper T v2 synthesis (WP6a: active) ──────────────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    v2_final, v2_conf = helper_t_v2_shadow(triaged, all_verdicts)\n    timings[\"helper_t_v2\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # ── Stage 3a.5: RECONCILIATION GATE (WP3b) ──────────────────────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    reconciled_verdicts, reconciled_confidences = _reconciliation_gate(\n        final_verdicts, final_confidences, v2_final, v2_conf,\n    )\n    timings[\"reconciliation_gate\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # Use reconciled verdicts for downstream processing\n    final_verdicts = reconciled_verdicts\n    final_confidences = reconciled_confidences\n\n    # ── Stage 3b: Regulatory T-Cell meta-check (WP6a: v2 primary) ────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    v1_autoimmune, v1_reg_reason = regulatory_t_cell_check(\n        final_verdicts, triaged, max_rejection_rate,\n    )\n    v2_autoimmune, v2_reg_reason = regulatory_t_v2_shadow(\n        final_verdicts, triaged, max_rejection_rate,\n    )\n====\n    v1_final_verdicts, v1_final_confidences = helper_t_cell_synthesize(triaged, all_verdicts)\n    timings[\"helper_t\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # ── Stage 3a': Helper T v2 synthesis (WP6a: active) ──────────────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    v2_final_verdicts, v2_final_confidences = helper_t_v2_shadow(triaged, all_verdicts)\n    timings[\"helper_t_v2\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # ── Stage 3b: Regulatory T-Cell meta-check (WP6a: v2 primary) ────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    v1_autoimmune, v1_reg_reason = regulatory_t_cell_check(\n        v1_final_verdicts, triaged, max_rejection_rate,\n    )\n    v2_autoimmune, v2_reg_reason = regulatory_t_v2_shadow(\n        v2_final_verdicts, triaged, max_rejection_rate,\n    )\n    timings[\"regulatory_t\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # ── Stage 3a.5: RECONCILIATION GATE (WP3b) ──────────────────────\n    t0 = time.monotonic()\n    reconciled_verdicts, reconciled_confidences = _reconciliation_gate(\n        v1_final_verdicts, v1_final_confidences,\n        v2_final_verdicts, v2_final_confidences,\n    )\n    timings[\"reconciliation_gate\"] = round(time.monotonic() - t0, 4)\n\n    # Use reconciled verdicts for downstream processing\n    final_verdicts = reconciled_verdicts\n    final_confidences = reconciled_confidences\n>>>>",
