)\n            return rfc9162_verify_inclusion(leaf_data, proof[\"proof\"], root_bytes)\n        except (KeyError, ValueError, TypeError, AttributeError):\n            return False\n>>>>\nFOLLOW: _cli_verify_proof currently reimplements verification logic directly instead of calling this method. To preserve one verification policy, the CLI should be updated to use VerificationChain().verify_inclusion_proof(...) or mirror the same strict equality check. Otherwise library and CLI behavior diverge.",
